# Double yakuman — ruleset difference (rules.md §1 natural_double_yakuman, §2.2, §4.3).
# Seat 1 holds 4 completed concealed triplets + tanki 5s (111m 999m 111p 999p 5s).
# Seat 0 discards 5s -> Seat 1 rons 5s for Suuankou Tanki!
# - Mahjong Soul: natural double yakuman (2x) -> non-dealer ron = 64000 from Seat 0.
# - Tenhou: single yakuman (1x) -> non-dealer ron = 32000 from Seat 0.

